Package: skyscapeR
Type: Package
Title: Data Analysis and Visualization for Skyscape Archaeology
Version: 2.0
Date: 2026-11-01
Authors@R: c(person("Fabio", "Silva", email = "fsilva@stonexsky.com", role = c("aut", "cre")), person("Billy", "Finnimore", email = "billy.finnimore@hotmail.co.uk", role = c("ctb")), person("Victor", "Reijs", role = "ctb"), person("Rita", "Gautschy", role = "ctb"))
Maintainer: Fabio Silva <fsilva@stonexsky.com>
Description: Investigate how archaeological sites and structures relate to
    the landscape and sky. Reduce field measurements, reconstruct local
    horizons and archaeological features, and propagate measurement uncertainty
    into distributions of astronomical declination. Explore celestial positions,
    visibility and seasonal events at modern and prehistoric epochs, visualise
    sightlines, and compare orientation distributions with random or specified
    null models (Silva 2020 <doi:10.1016/j.jas.2020.105138>,
    Silva and Lomsdalen 2025 <doi:10.1007/s12520-025-02208-4>).
URL: https://github.com/stonexsky/skyscapeR
BugReports: https://github.com/stonexsky/skyscapeR/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1), swephR
Imports: parallel, methods, oce (>= 1.8-4), utils, tools, stats,
        graphics, grDevices, plotrix, zoo
Additional_repositories: https://rstub.r-universe.dev
License: GPL (>= 2)
Copyright: See inst/COPYRIGHTS for bundled data attribution and licence
        notices.
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
LazyDataCompression: xz
